we're allowed to bring other people in to show the success that we're having with the karaoke. Word spread, karaoke spread. And it got the point where karaoke was being done seven nights a week. in Manhattan. Karaoke was so popular, it was essentially keeping laser disc technology afloat in the 90s. It was also generating a ton of work

